绔熷�勬兂閭ｆ妧鑳斤紒鈥�"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "凤逆天:杀手狂妃", "content_zh": "第七章 遇到挑衅风轻阁，清晨。凰冷月的眼猛地睁开。前世养成的良好作息让她在最短的时间内恢复了精力。经过一个晚上的修整。她接受了本尊真正凰冷月的记忆。通过这个记忆，她了解到了关于西川国的大部分常识。很悲催的，她穿越过来的不是中国什么古代那个朝代，而是一个根本不存在历史上的大陆，叫做忘川大陆。而忘川大陆上还分成好几个疆域。她所处的疆域就是人族疆域。在这个广袤的人族疆域上，存在着四个国家。东陵，西川，南朝，北陵。而这个奇异的大陆上，每个人都有灵力。所谓的灵力由高到低，分为七等，就是红橙黄绿蓝靛紫七段，每一段对应的是：灵者，灵师，灵导，灵尊，灵宗，灵帝，灵祖。七个等级分别从低到高有十个阶段，一阶，二阶，……十阶。这还不算，每个人的灵力因为修炼侧重点不同，有五大元素，分别是金木水火土。每一种元素的灵力修炼者按照升级等级不同而不同。很多人三岁开始就有一定的灵力，不过天生灵力的高低都是按照个人的灵魂感知力而定的，有的人灵魂感知力好，自然天生的灵力就强一些的。但是，三岁的时候一点灵力都没有的人，在这个大大陆上简直就是奇迹的存在。而自己，很不幸的就是那个奇迹！放眼整个西川，只有连城魅和少部分大家族长老达到了灵师级别，要知道，灵导及以上等级的，在西川大陆，那就像是神话一样的存在，寥寥无几，就算有，也是身份地位非常高的，那样的人只存于于在一些高等学府或者是各大门派。其余的不用说，肯定清一色的都是灵者级别。通过接受这具身体的记忆，凰冷月在最短时间内吸收了关于这个大陆的知识。虽然两种记忆力的碰撞十分痛苦，但是生性十分坚韧的她也硬生生忍耐了下来。凰冷月又梳理了一遍脑中的记忆，这才利落起身，开始整理自己。脸盆中显出一张倾城美貌的脸，当然这张脸因为先前的花痴懦弱显得很令人讨厌，可是现在换了一种傲然神气，就立刻像是蒙尘了的玉石被洗干净一样，散发出耀眼的光彩。忽然，她手中一顿，侧耳倾听。一阵脚步声明显朝着她这边而来。并且是两个人的。不久。“九夫人好。”门外一个阴阳怪气的女声传来。“请问九夫人醒了吗？”见凰冷月不回答，那声音又傲慢问。过了一会儿，门外另一个声音偷偷的问，“那个草包该不会没起床吧？”“估计是，据说没有灵力的人反应很差，说不定她现在还睡的跟死猪一样呢。”那声音带着浓浓的嘲讽。这时，门忽然打开，来人本爬在门上的身子一咕噜的向前扑到，像狗吃屎一样趴在地上。“好疼！”“大胆，竟敢暗算我们！”其中一个红衣丫鬟刚反应过来，就朝着凰冷月大吼。凰冷月双手环抱，秀眉一挑，“暗算？你们在我这鬼鬼祟祟的，我以为是招贼了。”眼前的两人，粗布麻衣，很轻易的出卖了她们丫鬟的身份。凰冷月无语，她这具身体人品到底有多差，怎么随便一个丫头家丁都可以骑在她头上？", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/fengnitian-shashoukuangfei/7.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 7 Encountering provocation in Fengqing Pavilion, early in the morning. Huang Lengyue's eyes suddenly opened. The good routine developed in her previous life allowed her to regain her energy in the shortest possible time. After a night of repairs. She accepted the memory of the real Huang Lengyue. Through this memory, she learned most of the common knowledge about Xichuan Kingdom. Sadly, the place she traveled to was not some ancient dynasty in China, but a continent that did not exist in history at all, called the Wangchuan Continent. And the Forgotten Continent is divided into several territories. The territory she is in is the territory of the human race. In this vast human territory, there are four countries. Dongling, Xichuan, Nanchao, Beiling. And on this strange continent, everyone has spiritual power. The so-called spiritual power is divided into seven levels from high to low, namely red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo and purple. Each section corresponds to: spiritual person, spiritual master, spiritual guide, spiritual master, spiritual sect, spiritual emperor, and spiritual ancestor. The seven levels have ten stages from low to high, first level, second level,... tenth level. Not to mention, everyone's spiritual power has different focus due to different cultivation. There are five elements, namely metal, wood, water, fire and earth. The spiritual practitioners of each element vary according to their upgrade levels. Many people have a certain amount of spiritual power since they are three years old, but the level of natural spiritual power is determined by the individual's soul perception. Some people have good soul perception, and naturally their natural spiritual power is stronger. However, a person who had no spiritual power at all at the age of three is simply a miracle on this continent. And I, unfortunately, am that miracle! Looking at the entire Xichuan, only Liancheng Mei and a few big family elders have reached the level of spiritual masters. You must know that spiritual guides and above are like myths in the Xichuan continent. There are very few of them. Even if they exist, they are of very high status. Such people only exist in some higher education institutions or major sects. Needless to say, the rest must all be at the spirit level. By accepting the memory of this body, Huang Lengyue absorbed the knowledge about this continent in the shortest possible time. Although the collision between the two memories was very painful, she was very tough by nature and endured it. Huang Lengyue combed through the memories in her mind again, then stood up neatly and began to organize herself. A beautiful face appeared in the washbasin. Of course, this face looked very annoying because of the cowardice and nymphomaniac before, but now it changed to a proud look, and it immediately looked like dusty jade being washed clean, exuding a dazzling brilliance. Suddenly, she paused in her hands and listened. A sound of footsteps was clearly coming towards her. And it's for two people. soon. \"Hello, Mrs. Ninth.\" A sinister female voice came from outside the door. \"Is Madam Ninth awake?\" When Huang Lengyue didn't answer, the voice asked arrogantly. After a while, another voice outside the door asked secretly, \"Is that idiot not getting up?\" \"I guess it is, it is said that people without spiritual power have poor reactions. Maybe she is still sleeping like a dead pig.\" The voice was full of ridicule. At this time, the door suddenly opened, and the person who had climbed on the door jumped forward, lying on the ground like a dog eating shit. \"It hurts!\" \"How dare you plot against us!\" One of the maids in red yelled at Huang Lengyue as soon as she realized what she was doing. Huang Lengyue crossed her arms and raised her eyebrows, \"Plotting? You are sneaking around here. I thought you were attracting thieves.\" The two people in front of me, dressed in coarse linen, could easily betray their identities as maids. Huang Lengyue was speechless. How bad was her body and character? How could any servant girl ride on her head?", "title_en": "Chapter 7"}